note aienux/crates/aienos-kernel/sec_continuity.om:
note Pure OM-2 port of crates/aienos-kernel Security, Admission, Artifact Loader,
note Continuity, Recovery, Budget, and Kernel Crypto subsystems.
note
note Library unit: no om2 header, no fn main, no globals, no structs.
note Compose with: si/directives/om2.om om/tls/sha2.om om/tls/aesgcm.om om/tls/gcmsiv.om
note Prefix: ksc_ / KSC_.

